# On a CPU without a required feature the kernel refuses to boot before it
# changes any state, with one line naming every missing feature. QEMU's
# qemu64 model lacks SMEP, SMAP and XSAVE (docs/design.md, CPU features).
cmdline: test=hello
qemu_args: -cpu qemu64
exit: failure
expect: microL4 kernel
expect: KERNEL PANIC at kernel/src/arch/x86_64/cpu.rs:
expect: CPU lacks SMEP SMAP XSAVE
